    "text": "If <math><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is the equation of a chord of the circle&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the equation of the circle with this chord as diameter is :"
